repository-code: https://github.com/TODO-USER/TODO-REPO
abstract: >-
  A four-layer Digital Twin framework for an ESP32-S3-instrumented hydroponic
  grow-box, used as a reproducible harness to benchmark a fixed-threshold
  baseline, a correlation-aware orchestrator, and a tabular Q-learning agent
  with a comfort-band reward on approximately 1.3 million telemetry records
  spanning two operating periods, over N=10 random seeds.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - reinforcement learning
  - Q-learning
  - hydroponics
  - microclimate control
  - Internet of Things
  - ESP32
  - controlled-environment agriculture
  - generalization
